# Bloodghast's landfall works from its owner's graveyard (CR 113.6k, 207.2c). Bot1 casts it on turn 3; Bot2's turn-4
# Toxic Deluge (X = 10) kills it and leaves Bot2 at exactly 10 life. Bot2's own Island entering afterwards is not a land
# Bot1 controls and triggers nothing. Bot1's turn-5 Swamp does: Bot1 returns Bloodghast, which has haste now that an
# opponent is at 10 (10 or less, not less than 10) and attacks at once.

